<title>Iraq: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/iraq/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-iraq-2026-11-11T15:29:16.775Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 11 Nov 2026 15:29:16 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Iran-linked drones attacked Iraq's Khor Mor gas field in Kurdish territory, halting production and cutting about 2.8 GW of power. Iraqi forces responded with airstrikes on three suspected militants and a tunnel in Kirkuk's Zghaitun Valley. Militia leaders are now seeking Chinese and Russian air-defence systems, prompting deployment of air defenses to fifty locations. Baghdad reopened the Sheeb border crossing with Iran after a three-week closure and agreed to withdraw Turkish forces from the Zilkan base by the end of 2026. Former Iraqi MP Ahmed al-Alwani was found dead in a Beirut apartment.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMie0FVX3lxTE5odkd1bGZOWGdpeXpQNlNHcWhfR3NTem9XcURWQnRIbHFBQ3paSzd1U0dhWWFxVG92UkxGX0ZpY0J5Z1dYSW13UUJRVkRXZGROUEhnWTFQT2Qwajd5c3dUWE95VW9VbWR4dVlkSVpscFVheDRtVkRNZS1tSQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;NPR&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE5OeVBweGtkNVFYa0x6dWd3cHZKRmtpQXp1bG44eHp3dEFMTk5wVWx5eWlVTlpZSF9GcFdCZTFKMjBHMEM1eUx0dU80bXRVSTNkcU5xc0c0emNTUkpVRkE?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxPdzVILXVQb1pXa053QmhuN0NQSjRRcEZRMjV1dGZBTXp3VWRSOG1wMlFnTjlfaFVxN0dqTllrUjhmbUs3MEY1ZktaZE9EUUg1cHQ0Z0ZwMDFyUHc4S1REdTRYUzR4bDJrbnFfQnRzZlRxR2txRUJXSGlhYlBTdG5JeGlIUlk5WEd4bDBWcy1mVzNlaGVyT1dtVVFTNjJ3NDk1SVNHSXkzVXBHN3BNMU1QWnJR?oc=5&quot;&gt;AP News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixwFBVV95cUxOSjc4dFNBUmN3UHp3Uk5FLUhNOElWeTVLRDNzSHZsSTAyUWZ4elN0eHdYUVJ5MDZBb0Y3MDNaNzlWbTRHMnctUFY5dGdNWWtKUnZTdHRPeXl1UUhlUE9mdTU0d2ZWTk9Hak9HaHVXaVBJQ3BoVXdfZnFxelF2aUc1MEV1U0JFQ1lDQ0s3RXhtRnk2dmoxZ2h4a3FRazE4Y3VpbGlDYW1zdE1DcDYxU3R4aE9zOWxkdTNuRVFxMzRlTDEtMDNHRmpr?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt